Here's a similar strategy for the minetown watch -  After
killing your first shopkeeper or getting a key by more
peaceful ways you can dance the watchmen into rooms.
Their moves are random but if you are adjacent to them
they will move away from you in a random direction.  With
patience this is enough to get each one to enter a
lockable room.  Then step out of the door, close it and
lock it.  It can take quite a while per watchman and a
couple of tries to lock it.  But once in they will stay there
until some digging monster removes a wall.  As have
been suggested it works a little better with a shop as the
shopkeeper tends to repair the walls faster than the
captive watch can escape.  Then explore deeper in the
mines for a while.  Since nothing changes on a level
unless you're on it this does work until you return.  Then
your pet's probably strong enough to take on at least
the watch captain.  But stay on the minetown level long
enough and diggers appear and appear.


